
---

## ⚙️ **`.gitignore`**

Here’s a clean `.gitignore` for Django + Python + VSCode + environment setup:

```gitignore
# Python
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.pyo
*.pyd
*.pyc
*.pdb
*.egg-info/
*.egg
build/
dist/

# Virtual Environment
venv/
env/
.venv/

# Django
db.sqlite3
/staticfiles/
/media/
/local_settings.py

# Environment Variables
.env
.env.local
.env.*.local

# IDEs and Editors
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo

# Logs and Caches
*.log
*.pot
*.pycache/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Coverage & Test
.coverage
htmlcov/
.tox/
nosetests.xml
coverage.xml

# OS Files
ehthumbs.db
Icon?
desktop.ini

# Pytest cache
.pytest_cache/

# Migrations (optional, if autogenerated)
*/migrations/__pycache__/
*/migrations/*.py
!*/migrations/__init__.py
